'''Rare Weapons''' are a rarity of [[weapons]] that are one tier above [[Uncommon Weapons]] and one tier below [[Legendary Weapons]]. These types of weapons have a 10% chance of being unboxed from [[boxes]], require twelve uncommon [[shards]] to [[Crafting|craft]] in the crafting station, can be obtained through [[:Category:Events|events]], and can be [[Trading|traded]] among players at any time. There are currently 84 different rare weapons in the game, 53 being [[:Category:Knives|knives]] and 31 being [[:Category:Guns|guns]].

